---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>Nosotros</h2>
      <p>
        En Baluarte Group nos especializamos en traer productos de alta calidad directamente desde Estados Unidos a Colombia. 
        Trabajamos con marcas reconocidas y garantizamos la autenticidad de cada articulo. 
        Nuestro compromiso es ofrecerte lo mejor en herramientas, deportes, belleza, cuidado del hogar y mucho mas, 
        con la confianza de que estas adquiriendo productos originales y de primera categoria.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="newsletter">
  <div class="container newsletter-inner">
    <div class="newsletter-content">
      <h2>Suscribete a Nuestro Boletin</h2>
      <p>Recibe las ultimas ofertas, novedades y descuentos exclusivos directamente en tu correo</p>
    </div>
    <form class="newsletter-form" id="newsletter-form">
      <div class="input-wrap">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="tu@correo.com"
          id="email-input"
          required
        />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Suscribirse</button>
      </div>
      <p class="newsletter-disclaimer">
        Al suscribirte, aceptas recibir correos de marketing. Puedes darte de baja en cualquier momento.
      </p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 96px 0;
    background: var(--clr-surface);
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #1e40af;
  }

  .about-content p {
    color: var(--clr-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .newsletter {
    padding: 96px 0;
    background: var(--clr-primary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .newsletter::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px;
    right: -100px;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200,149,106,0.15), transparent);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .newsletter::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -100px;
    left: -50px;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200,149,106,0.1), transparent);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .newsletter-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .newsletter-content {
    flex: 1;
    color: white;
  }

  .newsletter-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .newsletter-content p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .newsletter-form {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 460px;
  }

  .input-wrap {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .input-wrap input {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    color: white;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .input-wrap input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .input-wrap input:focus {
    border-color: var(--clr-accent);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }

  .newsletter-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .newsletter-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .newsletter-form {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .input-wrap {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.getElementById('newsletter-form')?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const input = document.getElementById('email-input') as HTMLInputElement;
    const btn = (e.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement).querySelector('button');

    if (btn) {
      btn.textContent = '¡Suscrito! ✓';
      btn.style.background = '#27ae60';
    }

    input.value = '';

    setTimeout(() => {
      if (btn) {
        btn.textContent = 'Suscribirse';
        btn.style.background = '';
      }
    }, 3000);
  });
</script>
